        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Dr Shamsh Kassim-Lakha awarded Hilal-e-Imtiaz"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The President of Pakistan, General Pervez Musharraf, has honoured Dr Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, with the Hilal-i-Imtiaz at an investiture ceremony in Islamabad in March 2003. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Kassim-Lakha has previously been awarded the Sitara-i-Imtiaz in recognition of his sustained and eminent services in the fields of education and healthcare."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
